From: riverosmejia <riverosmejia@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 15:39:38 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] fix(tui): a click on a path shows the file, instead of
 silently copying it
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Clicking a path copied `path:line` to the clipboard, which is invisible when it
works and impossible when the TUI runs over ssh (no WAYLAND_DISPLAY reaches
wl-copy). Now the click asks the app, through a small store, and the app opens
the file in the pager the /help panels use — same one answer everywhere.

PEEK_OPEN still wins when it is set (tmux/editor of the user's own).
